WEBVTT

00:00:01.490 --> 00:00:03.050
<i>After parting ways with Alma
 and the others,</i>

00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:06.100
<i>Seth arrived at the continent of Cyfandir.</i>

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:08.750
<i>He was attacked
 by the Merchant Barons on the way,</i>

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:11.030
<i>but he made it out in one piece
 with Grimm's help.</i>

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:14.530
<i>Caislean Merlin has been protected 
by the Knights-sorcerers</i>

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:16.150
<i>since ancient times.</i>

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:21.290
<i>In this city where humans
 and sorcerers live hand in hand,</i>

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:25.180
<i>Seth was in for a reunion 
he didn't expect.</i>

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:29.280
Huh?!

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:31.090
Melie?! Doc?!

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:33.150
Why are they here?!

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:48.650
Melie! Doc!

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:52.710
Melie?

00:00:59.020 --> 00:01:00.370
What's going on?

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:41.010
<b>The City of Knights 
-Caislean Merlin-</b>

00:02:38.070 --> 00:02:39.550
<i>"The City of Knights."</i>

00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:44.460
<i>In ancient times,</i>

00:02:44.460 --> 00:02:51.020
<i>the great sorcerer Merlin created enormous
 mountains to protect the people.</i>

00:02:52.660 --> 00:02:56.410
<i>The castle of Caislean Merlin sits
 in the middle of them,</i>

00:02:56.410 --> 00:02:58.500
<i>and that is where Seth is headed.</i>

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:03.660
<b>Caislean Merlin Castle Registration</b>

00:03:01.390 --> 00:03:03.660
Tell me about Radiant!

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:05.410
Radiant?

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:06.630
Yeah!

00:03:06.630 --> 00:03:09.150
On the name of the great Merlin...

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:13.290
I have no such information.

00:03:13.730 --> 00:03:14.970
Huh?!

00:03:14.970 --> 00:03:19.450
Weren't the Knights-sorcerers 
searching for Radiant?

00:03:19.450 --> 00:03:23.300
Yes, they were. A long time ago.

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:28.210
They say the great Merlin led the
 Knights-sorcerers in search of Radiant.

00:03:28.210 --> 00:03:30.560
Aw, man...

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:34.870
These days, they're focused on
 dealing with the Nemesis.

00:03:34.870 --> 00:03:38.570
Didn't you come here
 to enroll in knight training?

00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:40.490
Training?

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:44.260
The Knights-sorcerers receive requests
 to join the order

00:03:44.260 --> 00:03:47.750
and hold brief training periods
 for applicants.

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:50.360
Those who pass are recognized as

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:53.720
brilliant sorcerers capable 
of destroying the Nemesis.

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:55.180
Huh...

00:03:55.180 --> 00:03:57.120
The forms are right there.

00:03:57.120 --> 00:04:01.160
That's not what I'm here for! 
I'm looking for Radiant!

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:05.000
Come on, don't you have anything 
that might be a clue?

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:07.180
Well, let's see.

00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:11.580
There may be historical records of it
 in the castle library.

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:15.010
All right! Let me see them!

00:04:15.010 --> 00:04:16.490
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:04:16.490 --> 00:04:19.610
Priceless records and 
documents are stored there,

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:21.980
so only authorized personnel may enter.

00:04:21.980 --> 00:04:26.910
Aw... And how am I supposed
 to become authorized personnel?

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:30.350
Well, you have no connections.

00:04:30.350 --> 00:04:33.410
So your only chance is to be employed
 at the castle.

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:35.550
The positions we currently have open are...

00:04:35.550 --> 00:04:39.270
Secretariat, which requires an academic test...

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:41.040
Nope! No way!

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:43.710
Or guard, or horse caretaker...

00:04:43.710 --> 00:04:46.390
but those positions don't
 have access to the library.

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:48.280
Trainees don't, either.

00:04:48.280 --> 00:04:51.980
That just leaves Knight-sorcerer applicants.

00:04:51.980 --> 00:04:55.140
That's it! I'll join the knights!

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:57.840
I just need to fill this out, right?

00:04:57.840 --> 00:04:59.180
You fail.

00:04:59.180 --> 00:05:00.400
Just like that?!

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:03.580
The Knights-sorcerers represent all of us.

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:05.950
Seeing one with horns
 would just scare people.

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:08.410
Conspicuous curses are nothing but trouble.

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:10.160
Well, then...

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:13.540
I can just do this! How about now?

00:05:13.970 --> 00:05:15.450
Right, that's fraud.

00:05:20.430 --> 00:05:22.690
No good, huh?

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:48.320
No way! If you ask me,
 we're lucky to be rid of him!

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:50.070
It feels great!

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:55.070
Honestly, Doc...

00:05:55.070 --> 00:05:57.430
Always trying to put up a tough front.

00:05:57.430 --> 00:06:00.550
Yeah! Always with the tough front!

00:05:58.080 --> 00:06:05.150
Say, Doc... What kind of place
 is this "Caislean Merlin" that Seth went to?

00:06:05.150 --> 00:06:08.090
You know everything, don't you?
 So tell us.

00:06:09.380 --> 00:06:12.740
It's the capital of Cyfandir, Miss Melba.

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:16.610
Long ago, a sorcerer named Merlin

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:21.700
became a legend when he saved the people there
 and founded the nation.

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:24.450
Because of that,
 there's very little prejudice,

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:28.270
and to this day,
 lots of sorcerers live there.

00:06:29.230 --> 00:06:32.210
My! You have so much knowledge, Doc!

00:06:32.210 --> 00:06:35.950
Well, investigation and
 research are my specialty!

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:39.800
Oh? I thought being in debt was your specialty.

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:42.020
That wasn't even me!

00:06:42.020 --> 00:06:45.920
Cyfandir is an ancient land
 with a long history.

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:50.100
Many texts concerning magic are stored there.

00:06:50.100 --> 00:06:51.390
Huh...

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:56.620
Plus, I hear the Knights-sorcerers 
are assembling lots of sorcerers

00:06:56.620 --> 00:07:00.310
and teaching them how to fight Nemesis.

00:07:01.090 --> 00:07:03.900
Is that true?

00:07:04.300 --> 00:07:05.400
Melie?

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:07.500
I don't know the details.

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:10.390
But those who pass their training

00:07:10.390 --> 00:07:14.780
are recognized as individuals with the power
 to fight the Nemesis.

00:07:17.230 --> 00:07:18.310
Melie?

00:07:26.180 --> 00:07:28.910
Hey! Melie!

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:33.100
Doc... Mister Boobrie...

00:07:35.610 --> 00:07:36.660
Blast it.

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:41.000
I can't wait until I have
 my long, grown-up legs back.

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:44.810
What's the matter?

00:07:45.140 --> 00:07:48.060
Well, I'm just... you know...

00:07:48.060 --> 00:07:49.800
Taking a walk!

00:07:49.800 --> 00:07:52.820
Nothing beats a nice walk 
after drinking coffee!

00:07:53.850 --> 00:07:55.020
I see.

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:58.740
Uh, hey!

00:08:13.030 --> 00:08:15.090
A long time ago...

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:18.270
Before I came to Artemis...

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:22.350
I did something
 that could never be undone.

00:08:27.070 --> 00:08:30.310
I've been trying so hard ever since then,

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:36.390
but I don't think
 anything has changed at all.

00:08:41.140 --> 00:08:42.740
I'm still just...

00:08:43.170 --> 00:08:45.390
You're a fantastic Hunter!

00:08:46.860 --> 00:08:47.830
Doc?

00:08:49.030 --> 00:08:53.630
You think I'd hire anyone as my assistant
 if they couldn't handle the job?

00:08:55.790 --> 00:08:58.470
Thank you, Doc.

00:08:59.650 --> 00:09:00.390
But...

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:03.330
That's not enough.

00:09:12.270 --> 00:09:14.180
<i>What could have happened?</i>

00:09:20.210 --> 00:09:23.250
Well, this sucks.

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:27.260
I came all the way out here,

00:09:27.260 --> 00:09:30.050
and I still can't find a single clue
 about Radiant.

00:09:36.370 --> 00:09:37.770
This statue...

00:09:40.690 --> 00:09:42.430
Merlin?

00:09:45.250 --> 00:09:47.100
So you're Merlin?

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:49.510
I hear you were a legendary sorcerer.

00:09:50.300 --> 00:09:53.210
So, you were looking for Radiant?

00:09:53.630 --> 00:09:56.580
If you found anything, 
could you tell me?

00:09:57.980 --> 00:09:59.700
Like what the Nemesis are,

00:10:00.260 --> 00:10:02.620
and whether they're really evil.

00:10:05.610 --> 00:10:07.910
How can I get into that library?

00:10:08.770 --> 00:10:11.210
Just pretend you're ivy.

00:10:14.470 --> 00:10:17.590
Nobody questions ivy.

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:21.230
Who... are you?

00:10:21.230 --> 00:10:23.450
The fairy of the statue.

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:24.430
Fairy?!

00:10:24.430 --> 00:10:27.080
I'm an amazing fairy!

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:30.540
Wow... I've never seen a fairy before.

00:10:33.780 --> 00:10:35.830
Wait, you're a human!

00:10:37.710 --> 00:10:41.750
Asking a statue questions 
won't get you any answers.

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:45.620
That reeks!

00:10:46.110 --> 00:10:49.290
And as you can see,
 farting doesn't change anything, either.

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:52.390
Don't just let one rip
 out of nowhere, you old weirdo!

00:10:54.470 --> 00:10:58.490
Myr here specializes in unlawful entry.

00:10:58.490 --> 00:11:00.320
"Unlawful entry"?

00:11:00.320 --> 00:11:04.260
You mean... you know a way 
to sneak into the castle?

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:06.770
Want to hear my advice?

00:11:07.130 --> 00:11:08.020
Yeah!

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:16.910
Let me tell you the story 
of a young Knight-sorcerer.

00:11:16.910 --> 00:11:20.050
His name was Gontar.

00:11:20.050 --> 00:11:25.250
He loved his faithful war horse dearly.

00:11:26.150 --> 00:11:29.050
He loved it
 as a boy loves his girlfriend!

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:33.300
He loved it as a man loves his wife!

00:11:33.300 --> 00:11:37.250
He loved it so much that...

00:11:36.310 --> 00:11:38.630
What kind of weird song is that?

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:41.380
You just don't get it at all.

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:46.050
La, la, la... If you want to meet 
a Knight-sorcerer, la, la, la...

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:48.140
Just go to the stables.

00:11:48.450 --> 00:11:49.850
The stables?

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:52.700
But I want to go to the castle library.

00:11:52.700 --> 00:11:54.350
The library?

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:57.610
I can't stand that pile of garbage.

00:11:58.150 --> 00:12:03.300
There's no grass or even dirt
 inside the castle.

00:12:03.300 --> 00:12:05.030
What?!

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:09.160
Come, now. We're almost to the stables.

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:11.580
Look, I'm sorry,

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:15.670
but I don't want to see horses.
 I want to see Merlin's records.

00:12:16.110 --> 00:12:18.920
That's exactly what I mean by garbage!

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:19.710
Huh?

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:22.330
Wasn't Merlin a really big deal?

00:12:22.330 --> 00:12:26.210
I heard he saved everyone,
 and that he was looking for Radiant.

00:12:26.210 --> 00:12:29.860
Hmph. He was just an old hermit.

00:12:29.860 --> 00:12:30.560
Huh?

00:12:30.880 --> 00:12:35.780
Merlin was just a dirty, 
stinking, shaggy hooligan.

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:40.320
That's not what I heard.

00:12:41.430 --> 00:12:44.630
People always believe what's 
most convenient for...

00:12:57.210 --> 00:12:59.560
We need to hurry.

00:12:59.560 --> 00:13:02.210
Huh? Wait, don't leave me here!

00:13:04.460 --> 00:13:05.260
Is this it?

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:08.140
Sure is. Go on in!

00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:11.730
Hey, Myr!

00:13:11.730 --> 00:13:12.370
Here!

00:13:14.170 --> 00:13:17.480
The password is "Lulu is napping."

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:19.070
Huh?

00:13:24.170 --> 00:13:26.730
What the heck is going on?

00:13:37.770 --> 00:13:41.020
Those who are ready, 
depart immediately!

00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:44.690
Those who aren't ready, 
depart immediately, anyway!

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:45.630
Yes, sir!

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:47.000
Hurry up!

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:48.640
Come on, this way!

00:13:51.780 --> 00:13:54.930
Once we charge into the fight, 
you control the dragon.

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:56.530
R-Right!

00:13:57.180 --> 00:13:59.460
Not that way!

00:13:59.460 --> 00:14:01.200
Hey! Where are you going?

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:03.150
Ask this thing!

00:14:08.300 --> 00:14:09.410
Help!

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:13.980
Hey!

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:16.820
You, with the saddle!

00:14:17.970 --> 00:14:18.770
Me?

00:14:18.770 --> 00:14:20.170
Yes, you!

00:14:21.150 --> 00:14:22.670
Are you a newbie?

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:30.050
<b>[Merlin's Statue] 
The statue of the legendary sorcerer Merlin.
 It is said that he created giant mountains
 after taming a wild stag.</b>

00:14:31.900 --> 00:14:34.220
That's my saddle, isn't it?

00:14:34.910 --> 00:14:35.850
Where's Lulu?

00:14:36.240 --> 00:14:37.980
Uh...

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:41.610
The password is, "Lulu is napping."

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:44.230
Lulu is... napping?

00:14:44.230 --> 00:14:45.970
Again?

00:14:45.970 --> 00:14:47.820
For crying out loud...

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:49.490
Okay, put the saddle on here.

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:50.810
Saddle?

00:14:50.810 --> 00:14:52.900
The one you're holding, obviously!

00:14:53.590 --> 00:14:55.530
Hurry up! We're going to be late!

00:14:55.530 --> 00:14:57.000
R-Right...

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:59.410
Here. Right here.

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:01.260
Like... this?

00:15:02.340 --> 00:15:04.710
No, that's backward!

00:15:06.100 --> 00:15:08.540
How is turning it upside-down 
going to help?

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:10.250
R-Right...

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:14.420
You're a newbie, right?

00:15:14.420 --> 00:15:16.560
Uh...

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:19.550
Don't worry about the rest. 
I'll take care of it.

00:15:20.650 --> 00:15:21.990
Put this on.

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:25.900
Uh...

00:15:26.850 --> 00:15:29.400
You should probably leave your backpack here.

00:15:34.180 --> 00:15:36.410
That was so cool!

00:15:44.860 --> 00:15:46.670
You like it that much?

00:15:47.140 --> 00:15:48.800
Well, hop on.

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:51.680
U-Um, actually, I...

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:54.430
Hurry up! We're the last ones left!

00:15:55.730 --> 00:15:57.290
Hold on tight!

00:15:57.290 --> 00:15:59.180
W-W-Wait a second!

00:15:59.180 --> 00:16:01.180
Let's go, Draccoon!

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:09.440
Time to fly!

00:16:32.140 --> 00:16:34.550
Incredible!

00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:44.560
I've never done anything like this.

00:16:49.550 --> 00:16:51.610
Seriously, though, that Lulu...

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:55.070
She should have told me 
a newbie was coming.

00:16:55.550 --> 00:16:57.700
U-Um, listen...

00:16:58.180 --> 00:16:59.840
What's your name?

00:16:59.840 --> 00:17:01.880
Huh? Oh, uh...

00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:03.710
S-Seth!

00:17:04.420 --> 00:17:06.040
Nice to meet you, Seth!

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:09.840
I'm Ocoho.
 I'm a Knight-sorcerer applicant.

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:12.750
This is my raccoon-dragon, Draccoon.

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:17.640
Welcome to the order!

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:20.790
I'll be counting on your help
 to defeat the Nemesis!

00:17:20.790 --> 00:17:22.430
Did a Nemesis show up?

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:27.050
Jeez, Lulu didn't tell you
 anything, did she?

00:17:27.050 --> 00:17:28.940
You heard the horn, didn't you?

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:31.000
That's the signal to sortie.

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:32.860
So that's what that was.

00:17:32.860 --> 00:17:36.740
Okay, got it!
 We just need to take down the Nemesis, right?

00:17:37.050 --> 00:17:40.580
That's right.
 And you'll be steering Draccoon.

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:41.490
Huh?

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:42.370
Huh?

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:42.930
Huh?

00:17:42.930 --> 00:17:45.430
I've never ridden one 
of these things before,

00:17:45.430 --> 00:17:47.130
so I don't think I can do that.

00:17:47.130 --> 00:17:48.530
You haven't?!

00:17:48.530 --> 00:17:50.270
I can ride a broom, though!

00:17:50.270 --> 00:17:51.630
I don't have one right now, but...

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:53.590
What's the point, then?!

00:17:53.940 --> 00:17:57.580
Wait, what were you doing 
in the stables, then?

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:02.670
This old man with a crazy beard threw me in!

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:07.100
Myr again?!

00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:08.710
You know him?

00:18:08.710 --> 00:18:11.890
There's no one in the castle who doesn't!

00:18:11.890 --> 00:18:14.130
He's always messing with us!

00:18:15.510 --> 00:18:17.110
You've got to be kidding me!

00:18:17.110 --> 00:18:20.240
My dream of being ordained 
feels miles away now!

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:23.020
Ocoho, you all right?

00:18:23.020 --> 00:18:24.250
Mordred!

00:18:24.250 --> 00:18:26.870
I'm perfect! Just trying to focus!

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:30.630
Be ready, so you can act 
whenever the order is given!

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:35.310
Of course!
 I'll complete my duty this time!

00:18:35.310 --> 00:18:36.880
That's the spirit!

00:18:38.540 --> 00:18:41.640
Seems that this one's even bigger
 than the last one.

00:18:45.530 --> 00:18:47.290
What the heck is that huge thing?

00:18:47.290 --> 00:18:49.630
Another Spectral Nemesis?

00:18:49.630 --> 00:18:53.320
"Spectral"?
 Are those different from normal ones?

00:18:53.320 --> 00:18:55.930
Almost none of our attacks affect them.

00:18:55.930 --> 00:18:57.660
Well, no kidding.

00:18:57.660 --> 00:19:01.330
Only attacks using Fantasia 
work on Nemesis.

00:19:01.330 --> 00:19:03.560
Those are the attacks that don't work!

00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:04.370
Huh?!

00:19:04.850 --> 00:19:08.340
They just suddenly started 
showing up a while ago.

00:19:08.340 --> 00:19:12.000
In fact, we've seen more Spectral ones
 than regular ones lately.

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:15.290
If magic doesn't work, what can we do?

00:19:15.290 --> 00:19:16.670
Don't worry.

00:19:16.670 --> 00:19:20.160
Mordred and Sagramore's attacks still work.

00:19:20.160 --> 00:19:23.300
Marmot and Sakura... who?

00:19:23.900 --> 00:19:26.260
Mordred and Sagramore!

00:19:26.690 --> 00:19:29.130
They're knight applicants like me.

00:19:29.130 --> 00:19:30.650
Huh...

00:19:30.650 --> 00:19:31.890
Oh!

00:19:31.890 --> 00:19:34.510
The guys who were really popular
 in town earlier!

00:19:35.470 --> 00:19:36.620
Exactly.

00:19:37.930 --> 00:19:40.150
But I can be just as good.

00:19:40.730 --> 00:19:43.500
Applicants, assemble!

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:45.140
Look!

00:19:45.140 --> 00:19:48.910
Another repulsive Spectral Nemesis
 has appeared!

00:19:49.350 --> 00:19:52.070
I have two pieces of advice for you!

00:19:52.070 --> 00:19:56.820
First, sharpen your senses
 with the great Merlin's teachings in mind!

00:19:57.430 --> 00:19:58.920
Second...

00:19:59.490 --> 00:20:03.550
Second... is, uh...

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:05.520
What's second?

00:20:05.520 --> 00:20:08.750
Quiet! He's always like that!

00:20:08.750 --> 00:20:10.560
O-Oh...

00:20:11.130 --> 00:20:14.560
Anyway! We will launch our attack
 in four stages!

00:20:15.170 --> 00:20:19.510
Stage one will be to encircle it
 with seven of our dragons

00:20:19.510 --> 00:20:21.340
and cast confinement magic!

00:20:21.340 --> 00:20:22.310
Yes, sir!

00:20:22.810 --> 00:20:25.690
Stage two will be to fire attack magic

00:20:25.690 --> 00:20:28.770
from six of our dragons
 and start with its head!

00:20:28.770 --> 00:20:29.830
Yes, sir!

00:20:30.300 --> 00:20:35.460
Stage three will be Mordred
 and Sagramore dealing the final blow!

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:36.330
Yes, sir!

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:37.750
Understood.

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:40.890
And stage four will be...

00:20:41.790 --> 00:20:43.740
S-Stage four... uh...

00:20:43.740 --> 00:20:45.130
All right, let's move!

00:20:45.130 --> 00:20:46.720
Hoods on!

00:20:50.110 --> 00:20:51.550
Take the reins!

00:20:52.970 --> 00:20:55.480
Let's go! All together!

00:20:55.840 --> 00:20:57.360
Gysoni!

00:20:57.740 --> 00:20:58.990
Gysoni!

00:21:05.830 --> 00:21:07.860
What are those flames?

00:21:07.860 --> 00:21:09.370
It's Gysoni.

00:21:09.370 --> 00:21:10.870
"Gysoni"?

00:21:11.220 --> 00:21:14.870
We all synchronize
 with Lord Brangoire's consciousness.

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:17.310
Merging together into one consciousness

00:21:17.310 --> 00:21:21.470
creates immense Fantasia
 that far surpasses our individual abilities!

00:21:21.470 --> 00:21:24.760
Hey, do you think I could use that, too?

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:26.780
Be quiet!

00:21:26.780 --> 00:21:28.480
I'll miss the signal!

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:30.260
O-Okay!

00:21:30.570 --> 00:21:32.140
Cyfyngu!

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:42.150
Nothing's happening.

00:21:42.540 --> 00:21:44.100
Not a problem!

00:21:44.100 --> 00:21:48.030
The goal of this magic is to stop
 the Spectral's movements.

00:21:48.030 --> 00:21:49.530
Yeah, but...

00:21:50.030 --> 00:21:52.790
Even having all those dragons flying around

00:21:52.790 --> 00:21:55.540
isn't bothering this thing at all.

00:21:55.540 --> 00:21:57.520
Well, that's...

00:21:57.520 --> 00:22:00.870
There's not even a bit of eggshell anywhere,
 and it's glowing.

00:22:00.870 --> 00:22:02.980
Everything about it is weird.

00:22:02.980 --> 00:22:05.080
Enough! Just be quiet!

00:22:05.080 --> 00:22:07.330
I'm bad at Gysoni as it is!

00:22:07.330 --> 00:22:10.680
If you keep talking to me,
 I won't be able to hear anyone else!

00:22:11.180 --> 00:22:13.180
Ocoho, eyes forward!

00:22:13.180 --> 00:22:14.100
What?

00:22:14.100 --> 00:22:15.480
Get down!

00:22:15.480 --> 00:22:17.230
Repulse!

00:22:17.230 --> 00:22:18.480
Nothing's happening?

00:22:22.050 --> 00:22:23.360
Seth?

00:22:23.360 --> 00:22:25.990
Seth!

00:22:25.990 --> 00:22:29.990
To Be Continued

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:20.740
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:01.220 --> 00:24:04.500
<i>The Knights-sorcerers are at the mercy</i>

00:24:04.500 --> 00:24:07.190
<i>of the Spectral Nemesis's repeated attacks.</i>

00:24:07.860 --> 00:24:11.710
<i>Ocoho realizes the immense power
 hidden within Seth</i>

00:24:11.710 --> 00:24:13.230
<i>and takes an interest in him.</i>

00:24:14.210 --> 00:24:16.010
<i>When she disobeys orders,</i>

00:24:16.010 --> 00:24:19.060
<i>Ocoho is denounced during an audience 
with Queen Boudica, but then...</i>

00:24:19.630 --> 00:24:23.380
<i>Next time on <i>Radiant</i>,
 "The Bringer of Calamity."</i>

00:24:20.740 --> 00:24:25.020
<b>The Bringer of Calamity 
-Dullahan-</b>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.250
<b>The Battle to Be the Mascot</b>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.250
<b>Why me?</b>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.250
<b>End</b>
